        "TileImage": "$($repository 92c028a9-a72b-49bc-996b-194b8ddb795d).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rYour target location is Hokkaido’s GAMA private hospital. Within its operating theaters, unethical doctors are injecting hard drugs into unsuspecting patients — the police are aware, but won’t act. You must eliminate those patients before full addiction sets in, ensuring no further they succumb. Afterwards, the ICA federal police will take over legally. more intel follows\r\rGood luck, 47.",
